---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import TimeLineElement from "../components/cv/TimeLine.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Resume" sideBarActiveItemID="cv">
  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Professional Summary</div>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-10 text-justify">
    <text class="text-md">
      I'm a Software Engineer with 11<sup>+</sup> years of experience building scalable
      systems, APIs, and backend infrastructure across multiple industries.<br
      />
      I build backend systems that are designed to scale, not just to work.<br
      />
      I specialize in designing and developing reliable backend systems using Go,
      with strong focus on scalability, performance, and maintainability. My experience
      spans across API development, distributed systems, and asynchronous processing
      (queue, worker, retry strategies).<br />
      In my current role, I work on large-scale education platforms, building and
      maintaining services that handle complex data workflows and integrations. I’ve
      also been involved in system design discussions, backend architecture decisions,
      and improving service reliability.<br />
      Previously, I’ve worked on financial systems, land management platforms, and
      internal business tools, where I not only developed backend services but also
      led small teams, built queue-based notification systems, and managed infrastructure
      (Linux/CentOS).<br />
    </text>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Education</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container grid gap-4 mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Associate Degree (D3) - Informatics Management"
      subtitle="2011 - 2014 at Universitas Bina Sarana Informatika, Jakarta - Indonesia"
    />
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Experiences</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Software Backend Engineer at INA Digital Edu"
      subtitle="From Jan 2025 to Present at Perum Peruri, Jakarta, Indonesia"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-1 grid gap-2">
        <li>
          Designed and implemented a scalable database-driven worker engine to
          synchronize data with eKinerja third-party systems, processing ~2
          million records/day reliably
        </li>
        <li>
          Implemented retry mechanisms, idempotent processing, and failure
          recovery strategies to ensure consistency across distributed systems
        </li>
        <li>
          Designed queue partitioning and worker concurrency strategies to
          optimize throughput and resource utilization
        </li>
        <li>
          Built high-performance backend APIs and microservices using Golang,
          PostgreSQL, and Redis
        </li>
        <li>
          Developed analytics services powered by AlloyDB for near real-time
          teacher performance insights
        </li>
        <li>
          Contributed to architecture decisions, scalability planning, and
          production issue troubleshooting
        </li>
        <li>
          Collaborated with cross-functional teams to deliver government-scale
          education platforms with high availability requirements
        </li>
      </ul>
      <b>Keys:</b>
      <p>
        Golang, PostgreSQL, Redis, AlloyDB, GKE, Pub/Sub, Docker, Microservices,
        REST API
      </p><br />
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Software Backend Engineer at Govtech Edu"
      subtitle="From Jun 2022 to Dec 2024 at PT. Metranet, Jakarta, Indonesia"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-1 grid gap-2">
        <li>
          Deliver high quality API REST & gRPC with Golang and PostgreSQL to
          serve 6.7<sup>+</sup> active users and handle Single Sign On (SSO) for BelajarID
          account. This SSO service used by <a
            href="https://guru.kemdikbud.go.id"
            target="_blank"><b>Platform Merdeka Mengajar (PMM)</b></a
          >
          and <a href="https://raporpendidikan.kemdikbud.go.id" target="_blank"
            ><b>Rapor Pendidikan</b></a
          >.
        </li>
        <li>
          Involving to build <b>Asisten guRU</b> (ARU) AI chatbot, it's integrating
          with ChatGPT services to serve better experience Indonesia Teachers in using
          <a href="https://guru.kemdikbud.go.id" target="_blank"
            ><b>Platform Merdeka Mengajar (PMM)</b></a
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          Build Push Notification System and integrate with third parties such
          as OneSignal and Moengage. Its available for targetted user and
          non-targetted user that can be sent soon and scheduling.
        </li>
        <li>
          Manage Dataflow using ETL from BigQuery to Postgresql and vice versa,
          also monitoring with Airflow
        </li>
      </ul>
      <b>Keys:</b>
      <p>
        Golang, PostgreSQL, Redis, GKE, Pub/Sub, Emissary, Docker, Microservices
      </p><br />
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Senior Software Engineer"
      subtitle="From May 2015 to May 2022 at Jababeka Tbk., Cikarang - Bekasi, Indonesia"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-1 grid gap-2">
        <li>
          Led a team of 2–5 engineers to modernize legacy desktop-based
          financial systems into scalable web applications
        </li>
        <li>
          Designed and implemented enterprise workflow systems using Odoo and
          Laravel
        </li>
        <li>
          Integrated multiple internal systems through APIs to streamline
          operational and financial processes
        </li>
        <li>
          Improved operational efficiency and reduced infrastructure costs for
          enterprise users
        </li>
        <li>
          Achieved ~50% faster business processing time through workflow
          automation and system optimization
        </li>
        <li>
          Collaborated with business stakeholders to gather requirements and
          deliver scalable enterprise solutions
        </li>
      </ul>
      <b>Keys:</b>
      <p>PHP (Laravel), Python, Odoo, PostgreSQL, MySQL, SQL Server</p><br />
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Web Programmer"
      subtitle="From Jul 2014 to Apr 2015 at PT. Duaz Solusi, Jakarta, Indonesia"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-1 grid gap-2">
        <li>
          Create School Administration Management System using Codeigniter and
          MySQL
        </li>
        <li>
          Build PJU Administration System to manage Penerangan Jalan Umum assets
          using Codeigniter integrate with Google Maps API and MySQL
        </li>
      </ul>
      <b>Keys:</b>
      <p>Codeigniter, MySQL, Google Maps API</p><br />
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Junior Programmer"
      subtitle="From May 2013 to Jun 2014 at PT. Global Teknologi Media Integrasi, Jakarta, Indonesia"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-1 grid gap-2">
        <li>
          Oracle Developer at
          <i>Proyek Pengembangan Datawarehouse Data Kependudukan</i>
          for Directorate General of Population and Civil Registration, Ministry of
          Home Affairs
        </li>
        <li>
          Develop Log Monitoring System for track and monitoring from REST API
          using Codeigniter
        </li>
      </ul>
      <b>Keys:</b>
      <p>Oracle, Codeigniter, MySQL, REST API</p><br />
    </TimeLineElement>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Certifications</div>
  </div>

  <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-10 grid gap-2">
    <li>
      <a
        href="https://academy.dqlab.id/Certificate_check/result/DQLABINTP1NVFRGS#mycertificate"
        target="_blank"
        >Data Manipulation with Pandas (Part 1-2) - DQLab (2023)</a
      >
    </li>
    <li>
      <a
        href="https://academy.dqlab.id/Certificate_check/result/DQLABINTP1TMCWLU#mycertificate"
        target="_blank"
        >Python for Data Professional (Part 1-3) - DQLab (2023)</a
      >
    </li>
    <li>
      <a
        href="https://www.dicoding.com/certificates/L4PQ4YDLQXO1"
        target="_blank">Membuat Aplikasi Back-End (Node.js) - Dicoding (2022)</a
      >
    </li>
    <li>
      <a
        href="https://certificates.revou.co/m-anam-certificate-completion-damc22.pdf"
        target="_blank">Intro to Data Analytics - RevoU (2022)</a
      >
    </li>
    <li>
      <a
        href="https://www.dicoding.com/certificates/6RPND45K9Z2M"
        target="_blank">Google Cloud Engineer - Dicoding (2022)</a
      >
    </li>
    <li>
      <a
        href="https://www.dicoding.com/certificates/JLX1GJ965Z72"
        target="_blank"
        >Cloud Practitioner Essentials (AWS Cloud) - Dicoding (2022)</a
      >
    </li>
    <li>
      <a
        href="https://img-certificate.ruangguru.com/CHOIRULOJYR678VK/CERT-TNKTWQEL.jpg"
        target="_blank"
        >Merancang Produk Digital untuk Product Manager - RuangGuru (2022)</a
      >
    </li>
  </ul>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Skills</div>
  </div>

  <ul class="list-disc md:columns-4 columns-2 mx-6">
    <li>Golang</li>
    <li>Python</li>
    <li>Laravel</li>
    <li>React Native</li>
    <li>NodeJS</li>
    <li>NestJS</li>
    <li>NextJS</li>
    <li>VueJS</li>
    <li>Google Cloud Platform</li>
    <li>AWS Cloud</li>
    <li>PostgreSQL</li>
    <li>MySQL / MariaDB</li>
    <li>MSSQL</li>
    <li>Google Pubsub</li>
    <li>Redis</li>
    <li>Odoo ERP</li>
    <li>Codeigniter</li>
    <li>Tailwinds</li>
    <li>Bootstrap</li>
    <li>Big Query</li>
    <li>Docker</li>
    <li>Kubernetes</li>
    <li>Git / Gitlab / Github</li>
    <li>CI/CD</li>
  </ul>
</BaseLayout>
